## Interaction principles
- Keep note creation one tap away.
- Autosave with visible, unobtrusive save state.
- Confirm destructive actions.
- Ask permission only when a feature is first used, with an explanation.
- For reminders and alarms, show success only after the OS confirms scheduling.
- Provide graceful fallbacks when an OS integration is unavailable.
